{"version": 1, "sourceSha256": "45cf5f22300ba1b6e5ca957b0dce710826bf0322364569560603fa9a1b21c36e", "documents": [{"id": "genododi-test-044be5ee0c702c4f", "filename": "VITAMIN D.m4a", "sha256": "45cf5f22300ba1b6e5ca957b0dce710826bf0322364569560603fa9a1b21c36e", "assetPath": "supplied-materials/files/45cf5f22300ba1b6e5ca957b0dce710826bf0322364569560603fa9a1b21c36e.m4a", "textPath": "supplied-materials/text/45cf5f22300ba1b6e5ca957b0dce710826bf0322364569560603fa9a1b21c36e.json", "format": "m4a", "role": "recording"}, {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}], "units": [{"id": "jahshan-1WsMzFtpBtZWxfIjJWCEPlt_2WBHnNPq5-C-1-recording-45cf5f22300b", "label": "Jahshan set 17 · Part C · Extract 1", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "pages": [195], "questions": [{"number": 1, "prompt": "Dr Werner suggests that when it comes to vitamin D production\nSelect one:\nA. the sun is important.\nB. too much sun can be dangerous.\nC. without the sun we increase our chance of illness.", "sourcePage": 195, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 198, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": "What does Dr Werner say about the benefits of vitamin D?\nSelect one:\nA. It eliminates a lot of serious disease.\nB. More health practitioners should be supporting it.\nC. There are a lot of unsubstantiated theories about it.", "sourcePage": 195, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 198, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "Dr Werner mentions the benefits of sun protection in order to\nSelect one:\nA. highlight the importance of covering up.\nB. provide statistics on the incidence of cancer.\nC. discuss the different types of energy produced.", "sourcePage": 195, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 198, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "Dr Werner believes using sun protection doesn’t lead to vitamin D deficiency because\nSelect one:\nA. most people use low-SPF sunscreens.\nB. it is impossible to block all ultraviolet light.\nC. radiation levels are higher than they used to be.", "sourcePage": 195, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 198, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "According to Dr Werner, we don’t need very much sun exposure because\nSelect one:\nA. vitamin D deficiency is very rare.\nB. too much vitamin D can cause problems.\nC. even small quantities provide enough vitamin D.", "sourcePage": 195, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 198, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "Dr Werner believes everyone can acquire the necessary allowance of vitamin D from\nSelect one:\nA. a combination of food and supplements.\nB. dietary supplements alone.\nC. certain types of food.\n\nC3.2", "sourcePage": 195, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 198, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["45cf5f22300ba1b6e5ca957b0dce710826bf0322364569560603fa9a1b21c36e"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Matching sound verified in three separated windows; excerpt questions restricted to the spoken question range", "referenceRecordingSha256": "31d83103944801d88ef58968d9c498c6c2df3f756f9c5641535028ad8caeddd9"}, {"id": "jahshan-1WsMzFtpBtZWxfIjJWCEPlt_2WBHnNPq5-C-2-recording-45cf5f22300b", "label": "Jahshan set 17 · Part C · Extract 2", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "pages": [196], "questions": [{"number": 1, "prompt": "Roger believes radiation therapists are necessary because\nSelect one:\nA. there are so many different types of cancer.\nB. patients need help when battling cancer.\nC. it is an essential way to treat cancer.", "sourcePage": 196, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 198, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": "What led Roger into becoming a radiation therapist?\nSelect one:\nA. He was inspired by the man who treated his mum.\nB. He wanted to save people after his mum died from cancer.\nC. He learnt so much while his mum was dying and wanted to put it to use.", "sourcePage": 196, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 198, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "Roger says that when treating patients, radiation therapists\nSelect one:\nA. often work very long hours.\nB. regularly use a range of approaches.\nC. need to be aware of dangerous emission levels.", "sourcePage": 196, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 198, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "Roger mentions the case of his former patient, Susan, to\nSelect one:\nA. show that not everyone feels the same about radiation therapy.\nB. highlight the types of equipment used in radiation therapy.\nC. explain the steps involved in radiation therapy.", "sourcePage": 196, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 198, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "Why does Roger find teaching radiation therapy rewarding?\nSelect one:\nA. He likes knowing his students are making a difference.\nB. There is a lot that that he has learnt that he can pass on.\nC. It provides opportunities for him to work with past patients.", "sourcePage": 196, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 198, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "What does Roger suggest about cancer treatment in the future?\nSelect one:\nA. Further research is needed to reduce instances of the disease.\nB. More patients should be encouraged to talk about their condition.\nC. Physicians need to do a better job of reducing patient stress.", "sourcePage": 196, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 198, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacda